        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we develop deep insights into user interests and behavior, we curate the right content and service offerings compatible with user demand, achieving efficient user-centric commercialization.",
        "start_character": 25441,
        "end_character": 25633
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-157842",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-157842-c94570605f39323d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-157842",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to viral marketing, word of mouth referrals and repeat user visits driven by superior user experience, quality content and product offerings, we implement various branding and marketing measures to promote our brand awareness among existing and potential users with prudently managed sales and marketing expenses.",
        "start_character": 39022,
        "end_character": 39347
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-157842",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-157842-c94570605f39323d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-157842",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Over years of development, we have built a strong portfolio of Chinese anime IPs, including our inhouse produced and co-produced titles.",
        "start_character": 12950,
        "end_character": 13086
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-157842",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-157842-c94570605f39323d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-157842",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To further diversify our video offerings, we launched pay-to-view premium courses, delivering curated, high-value educational content designed to enhance user learning experiences.",
        "start_character": 13772,
        "end_character": 13952
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-157842",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-157842-c94570605f39323d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-157842",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under our agreements for exclusively distributed mobile games, we are typically responsible for the launch of the games, hosting and maintenance of game servers, determination of when and how to operate in-game promotions and customer services and the pricing of in-game virtual items, and making localized versions for overseas licensed games.",
        "start_character": 37071,
        "end_character": 37415
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-157842",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-157842-c94570605f39323d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-157842",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under our agreements for jointly operated mobile games, we are typically responsible for distributing games and providing payment solution and market promotion service.",
        "start_character": 37416,
        "end_character": 37584
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-157842",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-157842-c94570605f39323d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-157842",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We do not view our value proposition to users, business model or our revenue streams as directly comparable with other market players, because we operate a unique business model of operating a full-spectrum video community that offers comprehensive content offerings across short and mid-to-long form videos, PUGV, live broadcasting, OGV, mobile games and others, all on one integrated platform.",
        "start_character": 54395,
        "end_character": 54790
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-157842",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-157842-c94570605f39323d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-157842",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer a wide range of value-added services catering to our users’ diversified content needs, including live broadcasting, OGV, audio drama on Maoer, comics on Bilibili Comic and exclusive PUGV content in fan charging program and premium courses.",
        "start_character": 10646,
        "end_character": 10894
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-157842",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-157842-c94570605f39323d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-157842",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We update Bilibili Privacy Policy from time to time to be in line with the development of PRC laws and regulations, including modifications related to real-name authentication, information release and interactive content, customized recommendations, the necessity to maintain and enhance the security of our products and services, and dispute resolution.",
        "start_character": 41295,
        "end_character": 41649
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-157842",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-157842-c94570605f39323d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-157842",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a result of our direct ownership in our WFOE and the VIE contractual arrangements, we are regarded as the primary beneficiary of the VIEs.",
        "start_character": 1746,
        "end_character": 1887
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-157842",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-157842-c94570605f39323d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-157842",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As we continually dedicate ourselves to developing and enhancing our ESG initiatives, we have successfully reaffirmed our MSCI ESG rating A in 2025.",
        "start_character": 49516,
        "end_character": 49664
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-157842",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-157842-c94570605f39323d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-157842",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For our jointly operated mobile games, we entered into joint operating agreements with game developers and distributors pursuant to which we were granted non-exclusive licenses to promote and distribute games on our platform.",
